{"title":"Healthy Eating","puid":"c-sci-5-gb/lyl6xz","path":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/level-03","type":"normal","voiceLang":"en","voice":"m2_2025","instruction":{"voice":"f3_2025","speaker":true},"lsg":{"width":300},"hint":{"speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"feedback":{"speaker":true,"autoplay":false},"finishButton":false,"trainers":[{"trainer":"gapMulti","gapMode":"buttons","instruction":{"text":"Fill in the gaps."},"soundMode":"b","textAlign":"left","shuffleButtons":true,"atoms":[{"b":"Another important part of staying healthy is having <b>a balanced diet</b>. This means that you are ((++eating drinking)) food from each of the different <b>food groups</b>: <b>carbohydrates</b>, <b>fruits and vegetables</b>, <b>((++proteins peas))</b>, and <b>fats and sugars</b>.","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_food.groups.lsg"},{"b":"We need to eat <b>larger amounts</b> of the food at <b>the base</b> of the pyramid and ((++less more)) of the food at the top."},{"b":"Carbohydrates are broken down by the body and converted into ((++<b>energy</b> <b>vegetables</b>)) for cells and organs. They should make up <b>around 50%</b> of our daily food consumption. Foods containing carbohydrates include <b>bread</b>, <b>potatoes</b> and <b>pasta</b>.","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_carbs.lsg"},{"b":"Fruits and vegetables contain lots of vitamins and are ((++beneficial harmful)) for <b>gut health</b> — helping us to <b>digest</b> our food. This is because they are particularly rich in <b>fibre</b>.","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_fibre.lsg"},{"b":"Proteins are essential for the <b>repair</b> of our ((++muscles blood)). <b>Fish</b>, <b>meat</b>, <b>nuts</b> and <b>beans</b> all contain lots of protein.","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_protein.lsg"},{"b":"Fats are used to <b>absorb</b> ((++<b>vitamins</b> <b>germs</b>)) and <b>store energy</b> in the body. Sugars provide lots of energy, but should only be eaten in <b>small amounts</b>. Foods containing fats and sugar include <b>cookies</b>, <b>pastries</b> and <b>chocolate</b>.","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_fats.lsg"}]},{"trainer":"findAll","instruction":{"text":"Select the correct food group."},"soundMode":"a","lsg":{"lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_food.groups.lsg","width":400},"atoms":[{"a":"<b>proteins</b>","objects":[{"class":"protein","correct":true},{"class":"fats","correct":false},{"class":"carbs","correct":false},{"class":"fibre","correct":false}]},{"a":"<b>carbohydrates</b>","objects":[{"class":"carbs","correct":true},{"class":"fats","correct":false},{"class":"protein","correct":false},{"class":"fibre","correct":false}]},{"a":"<b>fats and sugars</b>","objects":[{"class":"fats","correct":true},{"class":"carbs","correct":false},{"class":"protein","correct":false},{"class":"fibre","correct":false}]},{"a":"<b>fruits and vegetables</b>","objects":[{"class":"fibre","correct":true},{"class":"fats","correct":false},{"class":"protein","correct":false},{"class":"carbs","correct":false}],"feedback":{"end":"As well as trying to include the right amount of each food group in your meals, remember to <b>stay hydrated</b> throughout the day too!"}}]},{"trainer":"dragGroup","instruction":{"text":"Decide whether these foods contain carbohydrates or protein. Drag them to the correct group."},"soundMode":"a","shuffleAtoms":true,"cats":[{"text":"carbohydrates","sound":"carbohydrates"},{"text":"protein","sound":"protein"}],"lsg":{"width":120},"atoms":[{"cat":0,"b":"bread","lsg":"/../c-sci-5-gb/topic-02-animals-and-humans/block-04-lifestyle-and-body-function/lsg/02_bread.lsg"},{"cat":1,"b":"fish",